  "post_title": "Julia Martínez Samaniego será reina infantil de Fira d'Onda 2015 sin acompañante ",
  "post_date": "2015-06-02 20:42:35",
  "post_name": "julia-martinez-samaniego-sera-reina-infantil-de-fira-donda-2015-sin-acompanante",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Sin categoría",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1040538.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">Julia Mart&iacute;nez Samaniego (de verde, en el centro) ha sido elegida la tarde de este martes por sorteo reina infantil de la Fira d&#39;Onda 2015. La ni&ntilde;a, que no tiene acompa&ntilde;ante, contar&aacute; con una corte de honor formada por tres parejitas: M&oacute;nica Guerrero P&eacute;rez y H&eacute;ctor Blanco Zaragoza, Alicia Meneu Bascu&ntilde;&aacute;n y Ricard Meneu Vizcaino, e Idaira Mart&iacute;nez Ram&iacute;rez con Ismael Attumi Ju&aacute;rez.</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/06/P1040498.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:16px;\">El sal&oacute;n de plenos del Ayuntamiento ha sido el escenario de este sorteo, que ha corrido a cargo de la actual reina infantil de la Fira, Sandra Navarro D&iacute;ez de los R&iacute;os, y su acompa&ntilde;ante, Vicent Ortells Prades, que estaban junto al alcalde, Salvador Aguilella Ramos.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040476.jpg\" alt=\"p1040476\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040477.jpg\" alt=\"p1040477\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040478.jpg\" alt=\"p1040478\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040479.jpg\" alt=\"p1040479\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040480.jpg\" alt=\"p1040480\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040483.jpg\" alt=\"p1040483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040484.jpg\" alt=\"p1040484\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040485.jpg\" alt=\"p1040485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040486.jpg\" alt=\"p1040486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040487.jpg\" alt=\"p1040487\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040490.jpg\" alt=\"p1040490\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040491.jpg\" alt=\"p1040491\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040492.jpg\" alt=\"p1040492\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040493.jpg\" alt=\"p1040493\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040494.jpg\" alt=\"p1040494\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040496.jpg\" alt=\"p1040496\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigreinainfantilfira15/p1040498.jpg\" alt=\"p1040498\